ty&rsquo;s 4 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 146% of normal in April to May but only 49% in July to August. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 21% of normal on the middle of the grids. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1963, with grid 20868 at 60%.</p>"}
